@AbGen.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:8080

### Health
GET {{AbGen.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### List projects
GET {{AbGen.Api_HostAddress}}/api/projects
Accept: application/json

### Create a project
POST {{AbGen.Api_HostAddress}}/api/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "The Wind in the Willows"
}

### Get a missing project (404)
GET {{AbGen.Api_HostAddress}}/api/projects/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json
